## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Core CRUD (không cần ClickUp)

#### [NEW] [apps/workforce/](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/)

Cấu trúc folder giống Expense:

```
apps/workforce/
├── components/
│   ├── WorkforceApp.tsx         — Shell (shared Navbar, tab router)
│   ├── WorkerList.tsx           — Danh sách nhân sự + hồ sơ + CRUD
│   ├── WorkerForm.tsx           — Form thêm/sửa nhân sự
│   ├── ContractManager.tsx      — Quản lý hợp đồng theo worker
│   ├── TaskList.tsx             — Danh sách task (nhập tay hoặc synced)
│   └── SettlementManager.tsx    — Tạo nghiệm thu tháng + export
├── hooks/
│   └── useWorkforceState.ts     — State management (giống useExpenseState)
└── services/
    └── workforceService.ts      — Supabase CRUD cho wf_* tables
```

#### [MODIFY] [apps.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/config/apps.ts)
Thêm Workforce vào app registry (icon 👷, color `#5856D6` — tím).

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/App.tsx)
Thêm route `workforce` → `WorkforceApp`.

#### [MODIFY] [types.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts)
Thêm interfaces: `Worker`, `WorkerContract`, `WorkforceTask`, `Settlement`, `SettlementTask`.

---

### Phase 2 — ClickUp Sync (sau Phase 1)

#### [NEW] [clickupService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/clickupService.ts)
- Gọi ClickUp API qua Edge Function proxy (tránh expose token ở frontend)
- `fetchTasks(listId)` → lấy tasks, map `status`, `assignee`, `date_done`
- `syncToDatabase()` → upsert vào `wf_tasks` bằng `clickup_task_id`

#### [NEW] Edge Function `clickup-sync-proxy`
- Nhận `{ listId, apiToken }` → gọi ClickUp API → trả về tasks
- Proxy để bảo mật API token

#### [MODIFY] TaskList.tsx
- Thêm nút "🔄 Sync ClickUp" → gọi `clickupService.syncToDatabase()`
- Hiển thị badge "Synced" / "Manual" trên mỗi task

---

### Phase 3 — Auto Settlement → Expense (sau Phase 2)

#### [MODIFY] SettlementManager.tsx
- Khi settlement đạt status `paid` → auto insert vào `expense_expenses`:
  - `title` = "Nghiệm thu [worker_name] — [period]"
  - `vendor` = worker.full_name
  - `category_id` = category "Freelancer" (auto-create nếu chưa có)
  - `project` & `client_name` = từ tasks
- Hiển thị link "Xem trong Expense" nếu đã có `expense_id`

